00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:36.600
Non-farm payrolls act as a high frequency gauge of economic momentum that directly shapes sector

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:42.940
rotation decisions. When actual hiring exceeds consensus by a wide margin as it did today,

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:49.420
markets typically reprice the path of interest rates higher. That repricing boosts financials

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:55.760
and value stocks while pressuring growth names. To apply this, pull the latest NFP release into a

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:03.220
simple spreadsheet and compare the surprise versus the prior three month average. Tilt a TFSA allocation

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:09.960
toward banks or pipelines only if the beat exceeds 50,000 jobs. And volume on financial ETFs

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:16.540
confirms the move. This approach worked well in 2023 and 2024 when repeated beats kept

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:22.500
financials outperforming growth during the hiking cycle. The main risk is that revisions can flip the

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:29.500
narrative within a month, so always size the tilt below 10% of the portfolio. That same discipline

